    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 6th level, you can tap into the forces around you and use them to bolster your spellwork.</p><p>When you cast a spell that targets only one creature, you can choose to deal extra damage to it equal to your druid level, or restore hit points to it equal to your druid level. You can choose to use this feature before or after an attack roll, but before any effects of the roll are applied.</p><p>You can use this feature twice. You regain expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p>",
